7. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '0209');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO exercises (id, name_fa, name_en, category, category_fa, equipment, equipment_fa, target_muscles, secondary_muscles, instructions_fa, gif_url, muscles_primary, muscles_secondary, instructions_en, source_id) VALUES ('ex_db_0210', 'Cable reverse wrist curl', 'Cable reverse wrist curl', 'arms', 'بازو', 'cable', 'سیم‌کش', 'forearms', 'forearms, wrists', '', '', 'forearm', '', '1. Attach a cable to a low pulley and sit on a bench facing the cable machine.
2. Grasp the cable handle with an overhand grip, palms facing down.
