3. Continue to raise the dumbbells until your biceps are fully contracted and the dumbbells are at shoulder level.
4. Hold the contracted position for a brief pause as you squeeze your biceps.
5. Inhale and slowly begin to lower the dumbbells back to the starting position.
6. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '1678');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO exercises (id, name_fa, name_en, category, category_fa, equipment, equipment_fa, target_muscles, secondary_muscles, instructions_fa, gif_url, muscles_primary, muscles_secondary, instructions_en, source_id) VALUES ('ex_db_0393', 'Dumbbell seated inner biceps curl', 'Dumbbell seated inner biceps curl', 'arms', 'بازو', 'dumbbell', 'دمبل', 'biceps', 'forearms', '', '', 'biceps', 'forearm', '1. Sit on a bench with your feet flat on the ground and hold a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing up.
2. Rest your upper arms on your thighs, allowing the dumbbells to hang down.
3. Keeping your upper arms stationary, curl the dumbbells up towards your shoulders by contracting your biceps.
4. Pause for a moment at the top, then slowly lower the dumbbells back down to the starting position.
5. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '0393');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO exercises (id, name_fa, name_en, category, category_fa, equipment, equipment_fa, target_muscles, secondary_muscles, instructions_fa, gif_url, muscles_primary, muscles_secondary, instructions_en, source_id) VALUES ('ex_db_0394', 'Dumbbell seated kickback', 'Dumbbell seated kickback', 'arms', 'بازو', 'dumbbell', 'دمبل', 'triceps', 'shoulders', '', '', 'triceps', 'deltoids', '1. Sit on a bench with your feet flat on the ground and hold a dumbbell in each hand.
2. Bend your knees slightly and lean forward from your hips, keeping your back straight.
3. Bring your upper arms close to your sides and keep your elbows bent at a 90-degree angle.
4. Extend your arms straight back, squeezing your triceps at the top of the movement.
5. Pause for a moment, then slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position.
6. Repeat for the desired number of repetitions.', '0394');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO exercises (id, name_fa, name_en, category, category_fa, equipment, equipment_fa, target_muscles, secondary_muscles, instructions_fa, gif_url, muscles_primary, muscles_secondary, instructions_en, source_id) VALUES ('ex_db_0396', 'Dumbbell seated lateral raise', 'Dumbbell seated lateral raise', 'shoulders', 'سرشانه', 'dumbbell', 'دمبل', 'delts', 'traps, upper back', '', '', 'deltoids', 'trapezius,upper-back', '1. Sit on a bench with your feet flat on the ground and a dumbbell in each hand, resting on your thighs.
